OL,3,AEd Sheeran's next US concerts cancelled
OL,4,Adue to storm warning
OL,5,
OL,6,FA statement from the venue said: "Due
OL,7,Fto the severe weather warnings in place
OL,8,Fin Boston and across New England
OL,9,Fthroughout the weekend and following
OL,10,Fconsultation with local officials, the
OL,11,Fpromoter and tour have made the
OL,12,Fdifficult decision to cancel the Ed
OL,13,FSheeran concerts at Gillette Stadium."
